            },
            "kind": "REWORK",
            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Edward A. James",
                        "email": "eajames@linux.ibm.com",
                        "username": "eddiejames"
                    },
                    "message": "This is needed for 6.12 kernel"
                },
                {
                    "file": "console-server.c",
                    "line": 241,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Andrew Jeffery",
                        "email": "andrew@codeconstruct.com.au",
                        "username": "amboar"
                    },
                    "message": "Is there an ABI documentation update for the change in behaviour? Can you please link to it if so? This seems surprising."
                },
                {
                    "file": "console-server.c",
                    "line": 241,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Edward A. James",
                        "email": "eajames@linux.ibm.com",
                        "username": "eddiejames"
                    },
                    "message": "I don't think this is really an ABI change, it's more the device hierarchy has changed somewhere along the line. We are accessing the parent device directory, not the tty directory itself."
                },
                {
                    "file": "console-server.c",
                    "line": 241,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Edward A. James",
                        "email": "eajames@linux.ibm.com",
                        "username": "eddiejames"
                    },
                    "message": "6.6:\n```# ls -l /sys/class/tty/\nlrwxrwxrwx    1 root     root             0 Aug  1 14:52 console -> ../../devices/virtual/tty/console\nlrwxrwxrwx    1 root     root             0 Aug  1 14:52 ptmx -> ../../devices/virtual/tty/ptmx\nlrwxrwxrwx    1 root     root             0 Aug  1 14:52 tty -> ../../devices/virtual/tty/tty\nlrwxrwxrwx    1 root     root             0 Aug  1 14:52 ttyS0 -> ../../devices/platform/ahb/1e780000.apb/1e788000.serial/tty/ttyS0\nlrwxrwxrwx    1 root     root             0 Aug  1 14:52 ttyS1 -> ../../devices/platform/ahb/1e780000.apb/1e78d000.serial/tty/ttyS1\nlrwxrwxrwx    1 root     root             0 Aug  1 14:52 ttyS2 -> ../../devices/platform/serial8250/tty/ttyS2\nlrwxrwxrwx    1 root     root             0 Aug  1 14:52 ttyS3 -> ../../devices/platform/serial8250/tty/ttyS3\nlrwxrwxrwx    1 root     root             0 Aug  1 14:52 ttyS4 -> ../../devices/platform/ahb/1e780000.apb/1e784000.serial/tty/ttyS4\nlrwxrwxrwx    1 root     root             0 Aug  1 14:52 ttyS5 -> ../../devices/platform/ahb/1e780000.apb/1e787000.serial/tty/ttyS5```\n\n\n6.12:\n```# ls -l /sys/class/tty/\nlrwxrwxrwx    1 root     root             0 Sep  9 19:18 console -> ../../devices/virtual/tty/console\nlrwxrwxrwx    1 root     root             0 Sep  9 19:18 ptmx -> ../../devices/virtual/tty/ptmx\nlrwxrwxrwx    1 root     root             0 Sep  9 19:18 tty -> ../../devices/virtual/tty/tty\nlrwxrwxrwx    1 root     root             0 Sep  9 19:18 ttyS0 -> ../../devices/platform/ahb/1e780000.apb/1e788000.serial/1e788000.serial:0/1e788000.serial:0.0/tty/ttyS0\nlrwxrwxrwx    1 root     root             0 Sep  9 19:18 ttyS1 -> ../../devices/platform/ahb/1e780000.apb/1e78d000.serial/1e78d000.serial:0/1e78d000.serial:0.0/tty/ttyS1\nlrwxrwxrwx    1 root     root             0 Sep  9 19:18 ttyS2 -> ../../devices/platform/serial8250/serial8250:0/serial8250:0.2/tty/ttyS2\nlrwxrwxrwx    1 root     root             0 Sep  9 19:18 ttyS3 -> ../../devices/platform/serial8250/serial8250:0/serial8250:0.3/tty/ttyS3\nlrwxrwxrwx    1 root     root             0 Sep  9 19:18 ttyS4 -> ../../devices/platform/ahb/1e780000.apb/1e784000.serial/1e784000.serial:0/1e784000.serial:0.0/tty/ttyS4\nlrwxrwxrwx    1 root     root             0 Sep  9 19:18 ttyS5 -> ../../devices/platform/ahb/1e780000.apb/1e787000.serial/1e787000.serial:0/1e787000.serial:0.0/tty/ttyS5```"
                },
                {
                    "file": "console-server.c",
                    "line": 241,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Edward A. James",
                        "email": "eajames@linux.ibm.com",
                        "username": "eddiejames"
                    },
                    "message": "Done"
                },
                {
                    "file": "console-server.c",
                    "line": 246,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Andrew Jeffery",
                        "email": "andrew@codeconstruct.com.au",
                        "username": "amboar"
                    },
                    "message": "Please try the new path first, before the old path, so we exercise the new code-path when the new kernel is introduced and not when the old behaviour is removed."
                },
                {
                    "file": "console-server.c",
                    "line": 246,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Edward A. James",
                        "email": "eajames@linux.ibm.com",
                        "username": "eddiejames"
                    },
                    "message": "Acknowledged"
                }
            ],
